      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RING A BLUEY (4) scored two back when on speed but last start drifted back and could manage only a 7 length 4th at Sandown (30.45). The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Has ability and looks hard to stop. JUMBUK JOHNNY (3) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the money last time though when second (20.30) at Traralgon. Solid record here at this trip including three wins. Expecting another good run. PAY UP SALLY (1) kept coming to win after stalking the lead from a low draw (22.77) at Shepparton in Grade 5 over 390m. One of the key runners again. WARRIOR PAGE (6) has a solid strike rate from this box.",
